        "3. Sequence Construction\n",
        "\n",
        "* Lecture given:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\mathbf{x}_t = (y_{t-1}, y_{t-2}, \\ldots, y_{t-p})^\\top\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "* We extend it with calendar features:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\mathbf{x}_t =\n",
        "\\left(\n",
        "y_{t-1}, \\ldots, y_{t-p},\n",
        "\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi\\,\\text{pod}_t}{1}\\right),\n",
        "\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi\\,\\text{pod}_t}{1}\\right),\n",
        "\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi\\,\\text{dow}_t}{7}\\right),\n",
        "\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi\\,\\text{dow}_t}{7}\\right),\n",
        "\\text{is\\_weekend}_t\n",
        "\\right)\n",
        "$$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "cGs8pEk1PvJ-",
