    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "BIaUQfP4T45T"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Hyperparameters tuned** (same as MLP)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "1.   Lookback window `p`\n",
        "2.   Hidden size `k`\n",
